OL,3,AOutrage in Nepal over rape and murder
OL,4,Aof three-year-old girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FActivists and politicians in Nepal have
OL,7,Furged the government to enact tougher
OL,8,Flaws as the alleged rape and murder of
OL,9,Fa three-year-old girl has caused
OL,10,Foutrage across the country.
OL,12,FNepal has seen continued protests since
OL,13,Fthe girl was found dead last week,
OL,14,Fthree days after she went missing in
OL,15,FMadhesh province.
OL,17,FNine people have been arrested in
OL,18,Fconnection with the case, a local
OL,19,Fpolice spokesman told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
